NVDA Haiku port — experimental development snapshot

The NVDA speech subsystem and the new Haiku platform adapters are distributed
under GNU GPL version 2 or later. See COPYING.txt for the complete authoritative
NVDA license, including its exceptions and notices. Original NVDA copyright
headers are preserved. This is an unofficial port, not a release by NV Access.

Unchanged files inherited from HaikuSpeak retain their MIT notices in
LICENSE-HaikuSpeak. The old MIT license does not replace the GPL license of
NVDA code or the new port adapters. The combined port is distributed under GPL.
